WEBVTT

00:03:27.328 --> 00:03:30.873
Slow down. Drive slowly.

00:03:31.499 --> 00:03:33.209
Cars are heading towards us.

00:03:36.003 --> 00:03:37.630
(Horn blares)

00:03:41.968 --> 00:03:44.095
Driver: I drive above the speed limit,

00:03:44.136 --> 00:03:47.556
one hand on the steering wheel,
one on my pistol,

00:03:47.598 --> 00:03:51.269
because the road
I drive Zarifa on every day

00:03:51.852 --> 00:03:55.064
between Kabul and Maidan Shar
is controlled by the Taliban.